# Policy: prettier formats what is named here and nothing else, so that what isn't, such as the portal's Jinja
# templates, a world's data or what a tool writes, is left as it is.
/*
!/frontend/
!/docs/
!/agents/
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md

# Compromise: chatddx stamp writes what changed as a git conflict, which prettier reads as markdown and reformats.
/docs/comments/
/docs/surfaces/
/docs/whoopses/

# Accommodating for what tools write: chatddx openapi, compared byte for byte by check.sh, pnpm, openapi-typescript and
# vite.
/frontend/openapi.json
/frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml
/frontend/src/lib/api/schema.d.ts
/frontend/dist/

# Accommodating for shadcn-svelte, whose components are copied in as it writes them.
/frontend/components.json
/frontend/src/lib/components/ui/
